        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Legends tell of a die named Snogbert...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does he have infinite sides, or only one?&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary infinite-sided (or one-sided?) die has fallen through layers of cave into the Brick Bunker at its bottom, and pieces of him chipped off on the way down! To get Snogbert home, you'll have to help him through 5 distinct worlds and collect his missing shards along the way. Each world is painted in its own color palette and adds new enemies, items, and missions to the fray! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Ready to Roll!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/7d6f945ea90c81e5b8338527a0944ece.poster.avif?t=1787673260\" aria-label=\"All 3 of Snogbert&#039;s palette swaps from Worlds 1-3 being chased by his Shadow\" width=528 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/7d6f945ea90c81e5b8338527a0944ece.webm?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Snogbert</i> is a one-room 2D platformer that combines arcade run-and-jump gameplay with roguelike progression. That means simple controls and a tray full of randomization! Each of the 5 worlds has 10 levels to offer, and these levels will be in a new, random order every time. Stay on your toes and soar above any obstacle! Use our hero's high jump and momentum-based wall-jump to find your own way through each level! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/fce870a305cf85aee8578b9ee5c72f17.poster.avif?t=1787673260\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/fce870a305cf85aee8578b9ee5c72f17.webm?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/fce870a305cf85aee8578b9ee5c72f17.mp4?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/15a3877937c466212bbcd0c85d5cd8eb.poster.avif?t=1787673260\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/15a3877937c466212bbcd0c85d5cd8eb.webm?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/15a3877937c466212bbcd0c85d5cd8eb.mp4?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's not all. In <i>Snogbert</i>, it's not just the levels that are random...it's the missions that happen in them! The Die is cast at the start of every level, and based on that roll, our hero could need to do anything from smelling flowers to outrunning shadow copies of himself! Each of these 10+ unique missions can happen in any level, and they'll change  the way you'll explore each one. Hope you're feeling lucky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/6d988c529a2422754f6067f4f699e9a2.poster.avif?t=1787673260\" aria-label=\"The Die is cast...\" width=340 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/6d988c529a2422754f6067f4f699e9a2.webm?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to arcade/rogue games? No problem! <i>Snogbert</i> offers 2 game modes for players of all skill levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a challenge in <strong>Rogue Mode</strong>, where health is shared between worlds and dying restarts the adventure from the beginning. Compete for the best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or enjoy a more relaxed experience in<strong> Casual Mode</strong>, where each world stays available once it's been reached. Take your time and jump back in whenever you want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Final</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these caves, random challenges lurk around every corner, and the biggest obstacle of all is the elusive and mysterious Shadowmaster... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with your help, there's nothing Snogbert can't do! Make use of our hero's unique momentum-based wall-jump to soar to new heights. Master his movement to roll through every platforming challenge. Overcome the random missions and escape from the caves! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So<strong> get ready to roll!</strong> It's... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/5e0fb4d354fc02afde94ef0d1916d055.avif?t=1787673260\" alt=\"Time to Get Snoggy! graffiti\" width=628 height=340 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Legends tell of a die named Snogbert...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does he have infinite sides, or only one?&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary infinite-sided (or one-sided?) die has fallen through layers of cave into the Brick Bunker at its bottom, and pieces of him chipped off on the way down! To get Snogbert home, you'll have to help him through 5 distinct worlds and collect his missing shards along the way. Each world is painted in its own color palette and adds new enemies, items, and missions to the fray! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Ready to Roll!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/7d6f945ea90c81e5b8338527a0944ece.poster.avif?t=1787673260\" aria-label=\"All 3 of Snogbert&#039;s palette swaps from Worlds 1-3 being chased by his Shadow\" width=528 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/7d6f945ea90c81e5b8338527a0944ece.webm?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Snogbert</i> is a one-room 2D platformer that combines arcade run-and-jump gameplay with roguelike progression. That means simple controls and a tray full of randomization! Each of the 5 worlds has 10 levels to offer, and these levels will be in a new, random order every time. Stay on your toes and soar above any obstacle! Use our hero's high jump and momentum-based wall-jump to find your own way through each level! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/fce870a305cf85aee8578b9ee5c72f17.poster.avif?t=1787673260\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/fce870a305cf85aee8578b9ee5c72f17.webm?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/fce870a305cf85aee8578b9ee5c72f17.mp4?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/15a3877937c466212bbcd0c85d5cd8eb.poster.avif?t=1787673260\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/15a3877937c466212bbcd0c85d5cd8eb.webm?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/15a3877937c466212bbcd0c85d5cd8eb.mp4?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's not all. In <i>Snogbert</i>, it's not just the levels that are random...it's the missions that happen in them! The Die is cast at the start of every level, and based on that roll, our hero could need to do anything from smelling flowers to outrunning shadow copies of himself! Each of these 10+ unique missions can happen in any level, and they'll change  the way you'll explore each one. Hope you're feeling lucky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/6d988c529a2422754f6067f4f699e9a2.poster.avif?t=1787673260\" aria-label=\"The Die is cast...\" width=340 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/6d988c529a2422754f6067f4f699e9a2.webm?t=1787673260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to arcade/rogue games? No problem! <i>Snogbert</i> offers 2 game modes for players of all skill levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a challenge in <strong>Rogue Mode</strong>, where health is shared between worlds and dying restarts the adventure from the beginning. Compete for the best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or enjoy a more relaxed experience in<strong> Casual Mode</strong>, where each world stays available once it's been reached. Take your time and jump back in whenever you want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Final</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these caves, random challenges lurk around every corner, and the biggest obstacle of all is the elusive and mysterious Shadowmaster... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with your help, there's nothing Snogbert can't do! Make use of our hero's unique momentum-based wall-jump to soar to new heights. Master his movement to roll through every platforming challenge. Overcome the random missions and escape from the caves! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So<strong> get ready to roll!</strong> It's... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742030/extras/5e0fb4d354fc02afde94ef0d1916d055.avif?t=1787673260\" alt=\"Time to Get Snoggy! graffiti\" width=628 height=340 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Help Snogbert find his missing shards and get back home in this run-and-jump roguelike! Overcome random missions in random levels, and show the Shadowmaster who's boss! Ready to roll?",
