        "reviews": "“The idea is fun, the color palette is pleasant...The randomness of the rooms really gives a lot to the replayability. I never felt like I was doing the same thing over and over again if I restarted the run.”<br>Seattle Indies (SIX) Jury<br><br>“Same layout, different task! This is like a game inside of a game now. This isn't normal.”<br>Games Aid<br><br>“We played several games here...Snogbert might be the favorite I've played so far. I just think this has a lot of replay value compared to them.”<br>RetroStation<br>",
